    "description": "US President Donald Trump's net approval rating has long hovered between -10 and -20, with him holding an unprecedentedly [stable approval rating](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Opinion_polling_on_the_first_Trump_presidency) during his first term.&#x20;\r\n\r\nDuring Trump's second term, his approval has moved more substantially, starting with a positive approval rating, before dropping into a negative rating, reaching the high teens as of December 2025.",
